                wrap_text("Conversations, reasoning traces, memories, Me history, source receipts, attachments, models and backups are kept. Memory consolidation uses reviewed summaries and source lineage; cache cleanup never decides what matters by matching words." and left + 24 and storage_y + 24 and content_width - 48 and 15 and muted)
